try point","categoryPathComponent":"2026TechMap_tutorial"},"sections":[{"estimatedTimeInMinutes":5,"kind":"hero","title":"Configure the app entry point","chapter":"6. Configure the app entry point","backgroundImage":"ch_thumbnail.png","image":"ch_thumbnail.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Connect "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppModel"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ContentView"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ImmersiveView"},{"type":"text","text":" in the app entry point. Register a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WindowGroup"},{"type":"text","text":" and an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ImmersiveSpace"},{"type":"text","text":", and configure the space to use the fully immersive ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"full"},{"type":"text","text":") style."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"contentSection":[{"kind":"contentAndMedia","mediaPosition":"trailing","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A visionOS app declares one or more scenes in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" of its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"App"},{"type":"text","text":" type. Register both a window ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WindowGroup"},{"type":"text","text":") and an immersive space ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ImmersiveSpace"},{"type":"text","text":") so the button in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ContentView"},{"type":"text","text":" can open "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ImmersiveView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"stepsSection":[{"type":"step","caption":[],"code":"OvertheCloudApp-01.swift","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OvertheCloudApp"},{"type":"text","text":" is the entry point that determines the app’s initial interface. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WindowGroup"},{"type":"text","text":" provides the main window, and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ContentView"},{"type":"text","text":" displays loading feedback and the space toggle."}]}],"runtimePreview":null},{"type":"step","caption":[],"code":"OvertheCloudApp-02.swift","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass the app’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"appModel"},{"type":"text","text":" into the main window so the view can read and update shared state. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"type":"text","text":" preserves the instance used by the app, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".environment(appModel)"},{"type":"text","text":" makes it available to the view. The immersive space in the next step uses this same model."}]}],"runtimePreview":null},{"type":"step","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Provide the same "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"appModel"},{"type":"text","text":" to share state across both views. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".full"},{"type":"text","text":" style hides the real-world background, surrounding the person with sky and clouds. Run the app to check asset loading and opening and closing the space."}]}],"code":"OvertheCloudApp-03.swift","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ImmersiveSpace"},{"type":"text","text":" registers the 3D space that the button can open. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SkySpace"},{"type":"text","text":" connects the opening request to this scene, and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ImmersiveView"},{"type":"text","text":" displays the sky and clouds."}]}],"runtimePreview":null}],"anchor":"Register-the-window-and-immersive-space","title":"Register the window and immersive space"},{"contentSection":[{"kind":"contentAndMedia","mediaPosition":"trailing","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All the components are now connected. Watch the completed app and compare its behavior with your own project."}]}]}],"stepsSection":[{"type":"step","caption":[],